TITLE Mix river water (pH 6, Cl 10 mg/L) and seawater (pH 8.1, Cl 19000 mg/L)
SOLUTION 1 River
    units mg/L
    pH 6.0
    Cl 10
SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    units mg/L
    pH 8.1
    Cl 19000
MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -pH true
    -activities H+
END
